**Survive**

Keep unity above 12. Keep Lewica above the 5% threshold.

**Build something larger**

Reach 13% polling and 65 unity. Survive the fiscal votes with a common line.
Preserve labour, progressive and movement credibility. Build media plus local
capacity above 70.

